OL,3,GNEWSACare leaver finds dream job after
OL,4,Ajungle trek
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care leaver is starting a new job
OL,7,Fafter returning from the trip of a
OL,8,Flifetime.
OL,10,FAfter a traumatic childhood, Milly was
OL,11,Fmoved to a children's home in Newcastle
OL,12,Fduring her secondary school years,
OL,13,Fwhere she gained confidence to apply
OL,14,Ffor, and win a place, on a 10-week
OL,15,Fadventure in Borneo.
OL,17,FShe said she had learned "not to be
OL,18,Fafraid to speak" during her trip, which
OL,19,Falso involved building roads.
OL,21,FMilly has now found employment with a
OL,22,Fbuilding firm.
